      "source": "Kenting Rush\u0000",
      "tokens": [
        "\\x00"
      ],
      "translation": "肯廷拉什\u0000",
      "status": "translated",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "DIAL_Z04.DDX#2",
      "node_id": 400003,
      "source": "Cavall Keep\u0000",
      "tokens": [
        "\\x00"
      ],
      "translation": "卡瓦爾堡\u0000",
      "status": "translated",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "DIAL_Z04.DDX#3",
      "node_id": 400004,
      "source": "Leighton Dink\n\"No longer can he hate his name.\"\u0000",
      "tokens": [
        "\\x0a",
        "\\x00"
      ],
      "translation": "萊頓．丁克\n「他再也無法厭惡自己的名字了。」\u0000",
      "status": "translated",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "DIAL_Z04.DDX#4",
      "node_id": 400005,
      "source": "Jason Verchew\n\"He sung off key.\"\u0000",
      "tokens": [
        "\\x0a",
        "\\x00"
      ],
      "translation": "傑森．維丘\n「他總是唱走音。」\u0000",
      "status": "translated",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "DIAL_Z04.DDX#5",
      "node_id": 400006,
      "source": "Nat Delars\n\"May the Goddess of Death be gentle.\"\u0000",
      "tokens": [
        "\\x0a",
        "\\x00"
      ],
      "translation": "納特．德拉爾斯\n「願死亡女神溫柔以待。」\u0000",
      "status": "translated",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "DIAL_Z04.DDX#6",
      "node_id": 400007,
      "source": "Marty Hippler\n\"Beloved by all.\"\u0000",
      "tokens": [
        "\\x0a",
        "\\x00"
      ],
      "translation": "馬蒂．希普勒\n「人人敬愛。」\u0000",
      "status": "translated",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "DIAL_Z04.DDX#7",
      "node_id": 400008,
      "source": "Jenny Gray\n\"Oh, to feel her sweet kiss.\"\u0000",
      "tokens": [
        "\\x0a",
        "\\x00"
      ],
      "translation": "珍妮．格雷\n「啊，願再嚐她那甜美的一吻。」\u0000",
      "status": "translated",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "DIAL_Z04.DDX#8",
      "node_id": 400009,
      "source": "Lincoln Albervant\n\"He lies here too.\"\u0000",
      "tokens": [
        "\\x0a",
        "\\x00"
      ],
      "translation": "林肯．奧伯凡特\n「他也長眠於此。」\u0000",
      "status": "translated",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "DIAL_Z04.DDX#9",
      "node_id": 400010,
      "source": "Sher Perlance\n\"She loved to dance.\"\u0000",
      "tokens": [
        "\\x0a",
        "\\x00"
      ],
      "translation": "雪兒．波蘭斯\n「她熱愛跳舞。」\u0000",
      "status": "translated",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "DIAL_Z04.DDX#10",
      "node_id": 400011,
      "source": "Corey Perlance\n\"Lost his life fighting a fire.\"\u0000",
      "tokens": [
        "\\x0a",
        "\\x00"
      ],
      "translation": "柯瑞．波蘭斯\n「殉職於一場祝融之災。」\u0000",
      "status": "translated",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "DIAL_Z04.DDX#11",
      "node_id": 400012,
      "source": "Damon Boyersmith\n\"He didn't want to go.\"\u0000",
      "tokens": [
        "\\x0a",
        "\\x00"
      ],
      "translation": "戴蒙．博耶史密斯\n「他並不想離開。」\u0000",
      "status": "translated",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "DIAL_Z04.DDX#12",
      "node_id": 400013,
      "source": "Kyle Bruning\n\"Always our loving son.\"\u0000",
      "tokens": [
        "\\x0a",
        "\\x00"
      ],
      "translation": "凱爾．布魯寧\n「永遠是我們摯愛的兒子。」\u0000",
      "status": "translated",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "DIAL_Z04.DDX#14",
      "node_id": null,
      "source": "\tIt's gone! Gods, the whole Keep is gone!\u0000",
      "tokens": [
        "\\x09",
        "\\x00"
      ],
      "translation": "\t不見了！諸神在上，整座堡壘都不見了！\u0000",
      "status": "translated",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "DIAL_Z04.DDX#15",
      "node_id": null,
      "source": "\tWhat's gone?\u0000",
      "tokens": [
        "\\x09",
        "\\x00"
      ],
      "translation": "\t什麼不見了？\u0000",
      "status": "translated",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "DIAL_Z04.DDX#16",
      "node_id": null,
      "source": "\tRemember when I told you that I had an uncle living near here, the count of Cavall Keep? His whole keep is gone! It should be right in front of us!\u0000",
      "tokens": [
        "\\x09",
        "\\x00"
      ],
      "translation": "\t還記得我跟你說過，我有個叔叔住在這附近，是卡瓦爾堡的伯爵嗎？他整座堡壘都不見了！明明應該就在我們眼前的！\u0000",
      "status": "translated",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "DIAL_Z04.DDX#17",
      "node_id": null,
      "source": "\tAre you sure you just haven't forgotten the way? Perhaps we've just made a wrong turn somewhere.\u0000",
      "tokens": [
        "\\x09",
        "\\x00"
      ],
      "translation": "\t你確定不是自己忘了路怎麼走嗎？也許我們只是在哪裡轉錯了彎。\u0000",
      "status": "translated",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "DIAL_Z04.DDX#18",
      "node_id": null,
      "source": "\tNo, no, no. I'm certain of it. Something very wrong is up around here...Perhaps we should go north, up into Cavall Keep itself. At least we could get some answers there...\u0000",
      "tokens": [
        "\\x09",
        "\\x00"
      ],
      "translation": "\t不，不，不。我很確定。這附近一定出了什麼大問題…或許我們該往北走，直接進卡瓦爾堡看看。至少在那裡能得到些答案…\u0000",
      "status": "translated",
      "notes": ""
    }
  ]
}